canon evidence add: refreshed the scenario index from 1 changed feature file(s) (specs/kind=feature/area=checkout/add.feature): 2 record(s) written
canon evidence add: unreviewed-promotion checkout — evidence for checkout.pay.01: brief not approved — .canon/changes/c-checkout/brief.md has no `Approved:` line, so the human has not answered it; once they do, record their words with `canon brief approve --change c-checkout --by <the human> --note "<their words>"`
canon evidence add: refused — stop, report the brief to the human and wait for their answer: nothing is built or attested for a subject before its brief is approved. Record their answer with `canon brief approve --by <the human> --note "<their words>"` only from that answer; to attest anyway, pass --override-reason <text>, which is recorded on the evidence record
